  "description": "Yu Ji-Tae, a regressor with unparalleled power. Even with that power and repeated regressions, he was unable to prevent the destruction of Earth. The cause of this destruction was four baby dragons who came to Earth to play. The story of a man who, rather than possessing absolute power, seeks to protect them and prevent destruction.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
